<title>ITALY: TENNIS-BOLOGNA INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BOLOGNA INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BOLOGNA, Italy 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the $328,000 Bologna international men's clay-court tennis tournament on Friday (prefix denotes seed):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals:</p>
<p>8-Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat 1-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) 6-3 6-7 7-5</p>
<p>Marzio Martelli (Italy) beat 5-Hicham Arazi (Morocco) 2-6 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>2-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Nicolas Lapentti (Ecuador) 4-6 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>6-Karim Alami (Morocco) beat Andrea Gaudenzi (Italy) 3-6 6-3 6-3</p>
</text>
